title: Stress
---
<<set $Goblin = GetPartDisplayName("Goblin")>>
<<set $Wiki = GetPartDisplayName("Wiki")>>
<<set $Soldier = GetPartDisplayName("Soldier")>>
<<set $Lady = GetPartDisplayName("Lady")>>
<<set $Hiki = GetPartDisplayName("Hiki")>>

{$Goblin}: Oh jeez, boss-man is close to boiling over.
<<wait  2.0>>
{$Hiki}: Oh no! Is that what that stress bar is for at the top?
<<wait  2.0>>
{$Goblin}: Oh yeah, that. I think one of our siblings got it installed for me.
<<wait  2.0>>
{$Goblin}: "Watch the Stress meter, Goblin. Its all you're good for."
<<wait  2.0>>
{$Hiki}: That's not nice! Why do they call you Goblin?
<<wait  3.0>>
{$Goblin}: The boss-man and I are close buddies like that. He gave me a name!
<<wait  2.0>>
===